sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Admin
    participant UI as HRMS Web
    participant SettingSvc as Setting Service
    participant DB as Setting DB
    participant Worker as Effective Change Worker
    participant Kafka as Kafka
    participant Consumer as Downstream Services

    Admin->>UI: Update Grade
    Admin->>UI: Select effectiveAt

    UI->>SettingSvc: UPDATE Grade<br/>effectiveAt

    SettingSvc->>SettingSvc: Validate effectiveAt

    alt effectiveAt invalid
        SettingSvc-->>UI: Reject request
    else valid
        SettingSvc->>DB: Validate company ownership
        SettingSvc->>DB: Validate no pending conflicting change
        SettingSvc->>DB: Create scheduled change
        SettingSvc-->>UI: Change scheduled
    end

    Note over DB,Worker: Time reaches effectiveAt

    Worker->>DB: Find due scheduled changes
    Worker->>DB: Claim change

    Worker->>DB: BEGIN
    Worker->>DB: Revalidate current state

    alt State still valid
        Worker->>DB: Apply new master-data state
        Worker->>DB: Preserve previous historical state
        Worker->>DB: Mark change APPLIED
        Worker->>DB: Write outbox event
        Worker->>DB: COMMIT

        Worker->>Kafka: Publish organizational change
        Kafka-->>Consumer: Synchronize local references
    else Conflict detected
        Worker->>DB: Mark change CONFLICT / FAILED
        Worker->>DB: COMMIT
    end